SY_TALK("Qzn9lXMWYVI",[[609,["Today we are here to celebrate Krishna","Puja."]],[619,["I went to America and they wanted me","to have a Mahakali Puja."]],[628,["But I said, no, let me talk about Krishna","only,"]],[633,["because we have to first realize what is","the strength of this Puja."]],[644,["How are we going to establish Shri Krishna","within ourselves?"]],[650,["He, Himself has said, that whenever there","is a downfall of dharma -"]],[658,["dharma doesn’t mean what we understand","as Hinduism, Christianity"]],[664,["or Islamic nonsense - it is not."]],[667,["Dharma means, our primordial taboos that","are built-in in the human beings."]],[681,["About these, I think aboriginals knew","better than we."]],[686,["But then what we did, we dominated them"]],[690,["and also they had to change their style","of life."]],[696,["The primordial taboos are only understood"]],[699,["if people are trying to understand oneself"]],[707,["or else, whatever has come to them through","tradition."]],[713,["Now, Sahaj Dharma is a little bit","different,"]],[718,["in the sense that it’s much higher than","the Sahaj ideas that we talk of,"]],[728,["but it’s much higher than even what Shri","Krishna said or Shri Rama said."]],[736,["First Shri Rama thought, best is to give","them disciplines."]],[742,["People should be serious about life,","have full idea"]],[748,["about their own being, they should","respect themselves."]],[753,["All these things were written down long","time back."]],[760,["Also, people, basically when they were","good people,"]],[765,["they understood that whatever is bad","for us, we should not do."]],[770,["These are primordial taboos."]],[773,["Now, these primordial taboos are built-in","within us."]],[778,["Now, supposing I say don’t drink, you will","go on drinking."]],[786,["If I say don’t tell lies, you will tell","lies."]],[791,["It’s the human nature, you see, is to go","against primordial taboo"]],[796,["because they think now, they have freedom,"]],[799,["freedom to do what they like."]],[802,["You are free people. Actually they are not."]],[807,["They are under the spell of all the kinds","of allurement, you can call it,"]],[815,["or temptations, which are against human","life."]],[822,["And it’s very natural to be a person","of Dharma."]],[829,["Small children mostly have it. For example,","I’ve seen children,"]],[834,["they feel very shy to take out their","clothes,"]],[838,["even small, small boys, I’ve seen."]],[840,["They won’t take out their clothes in","the presence of others. They feel shy."]],[848,["So, all these are described like"]],[850,["“Ya Devi Sarva Bhuteshu Lajja Rupena","Samsthita”."]],[854,["So, you should be shy, you should be humble"]],[861,["and respect your body – it’s very","important."]],[865,["In these modern times, exposure of body is","regarded as a great achievement of women."]],[872,["They are trying to become aboriginals, you","see."]],[875,["That time they never had these ideas and","they were not so confused, you see."]],[879,["So, even if their women were scantily","dressed,"]],[883,["it didn’t mean that it was some sort","of a sex"]],[887,["or some sort of an attraction for men"]],[893,["or men behaving in funny manners"]],[897,["to show that they have a special attraction","for women."]],[902,["I mean, why should you?"]],[907,["It is absolutely absurd that men should be","attracted to women"]],[913,["and women should be attracted to men -"]],[916,["and on the road, on the street, you go,","you see, just that going on!"]],[921,["This adharma is the worst I think, it’s","a curse."]],[927,["Because after coming to Sahaja Yoga also"]],[929,["people start doing this nonsense, you know."]],[931,["They should all go to lunatic asylum,","I think,"]],[934,["they are no good for Sahaja Yoga."]],[937,["But dharma gets established as soon as you","have the light of the Spirit."]],[942,["At the time of Shri Rama, He had to put","down: A, B, C, D, E, F."]],[952,["At the time of Moses, also, He had to put","down ten commandments -"]],[960,["but Krishna thought the other way round -"]],[965,["to establish a Dharma of pure love, pure","love."]],[974,["So, because He wanted that Shri Rama’s","taboos were forced on people,"]],[981,["just like Islamic, just like Christians -","never works."]],[986,["So, He thought better to ask them in their","freedom,"]],[990,["they must develop pure love."]],[993,["Radha, who was with Him, as His power,","is called as Alladha dayini."]],[1001,["She’s the one who gives joy. Pure joy!"]],[1008,["So, all these limited type of attractions","end up in trouble."]],[1016,["Now, drinking is against you, you know","that."]],[1019,["Today they are talking about tobacco,","tomorrow they’ll talk of drinking"]],[1024,["when they will find so many people","suffering from horrible livers and dying."]],[1031,["Then they will taboo it."]],[1033,["But it’s a natural taboo for your body."]],[1037,["If you do something all the time which is","not good for you,"]],[1042,["for your good life, you are becoming","adharmic."]],[1050,["This is to be understood very clearly"]],[1053,["that the Sahaja Dharma is that you are","just free -"]],[1064,["complete freedom from lust, greed and all","nonsense."]],[1069,["You are above it. You are above this."]],[1073,["Sahaj Dharma is above the Dharma"]],[1077,["established by Shri","Krishna or by Shri Rama."]],[1082,["Because you have reached that stage."]],[1085,["It’s in complete freedom you have to be","dharmic."]],[1090,["Whatever is not good for you, you should","not do."]],[1094,["I don’t have to tell you that you don’t do","this or you don’t do that."]],[1102,["Whatever I say may not be acceptable"]],[1105,["but immediately your vibrations will tell","you."]],[1108,["This is Sahaj Dharma. In the Sahaj Dharma","you get rid of all kinds of,"]],[1115,["as they say: (Hindi words) kaama, krodha,","mada, matsa, lobha, moha."]],[1118,["Means – lust, anger, attractions, then –","greed;"]],[1140,["that’s very important, greed – greed and","attractions."]],[1149,["Now, if you understand how people are","greedy; greedy for what?"]],[1158,["This America is dying of consumerism, you","see."]],[1163,["Now, see the trick of the trade:"]],[1166,["In America, you can borrow any amount","of money from the bank, no problem."]],[1173,["Now, even if you don’t borrow, they’ll send","you a letter,"]],[1180,["“Why don’t you take twenty thousand","checks we are sending you, why not have it?"]],[1185,["Ah, very rich you’ll become, you see – it’s","very nice to take the loan.”"]],[1193,["I was told some people used to come","to Ganapatipule after taking loans."]],[1197,["I said, “Stop that nonsense.”"]],[1201,["So they take the loan and then they come","to Ganapatipule."]],[1206,["All the time their mind is: “How will I pay","this loan, how will I manage?”"]],[1213,["All the time the attention is distracted,"]],[1216,["even when you want to do something good","to yourself by coming to Ganapatipule."]],[1223,["So, such a mind is not free."]],[1228,["The free mind is that which has attention","completely enlightened by the Spirit."]],[1238,["But problem is we are still rising out","of this human bondage"]],[1245,["to a higher life of realization."]],[1251,["And when we are going to that level, we","have to realize"]],[1258,["that we have to give up all these shackles,"]],[1263,["all these horrible things within us."]],[1267,["Like a bird, when it is born out","of the egg,"]],[1273,["shakes out all the parts of the egg."]],[1278,["Your brothers, your sisters, your father,","your mother, your husband;"]],[1282,["everybody – they’ll try to put you down."]],[1288,["Now, if they are drinking, they’ll say,","“Come along,"]],[1290,["you better have something to drink, you","are not social,"]],[1294,["you are useless, you are not up to date.","What is this nonsense?”"]],[1299,["That’s how a fashion starts and this","collective action of fashion"]],[1307,["didn’t come from Shri Krishna and not","in Sahaj."]],[1313,["In Sahaj, you are absolutely free from all","these nonsenses."]],[1322,["If you want, you can wear a good dress,"]],[1324,["if you don’t want you need not. You are","free."]],[1330,["You are free from money bondage. This is","very important."]],[1334,["Money bondage is another thing. I know","some Sahaja Yogis"]],[1337,["who came to Sahaja Yoga trying to make","money out of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1341,["You came to Sahaja Yoga for what?"]],[1344,["To get out of that money bondage."]],[1346,["In the Sahaj Dharma, to you money is","nothing but the dust of your feet."]],[1353,["Nothing so important."]],[1355,["Then, we have such a collective sense","of accepting nonsense."]],[1363,["That has to be dropped out, especially","in America, I was surprised."]],[1368,["Also in England. A fellow came as a hippie."]],[1380,["His hair was looking like some monkey,"]],[1386,["monkey’s better I must say, I don’t know","like what,"]],[1390,["all put together like a, you can say…"]],[1395,["I mean, there is nothing to compare, I tell","you."]],[1398,["So I asked him, “Why are you having such","hair?”"]],[1403,["He said, “Because I want to be primitive."]],[1405,["Now, we have to get to the primitiveness.”"]],[1408,["I said, “But your brain is modern,"]],[1411,["what is the use of growing your hair like","that?"]],[1413,["You think you can become primitive?","You cannot!”"]],[1419,["Then afterwards I learned that he died."]],[1423,["Another one like that came and he didn’t","die,"]],[1428,["but went to lunatic asylum."]],[1431,["Like that I met many, but why do you do it?"]],[1435,["Because that’s the fashion."]],[1438,["Now Italy, you know, is prospering because","of all kinds of designers."]],[1447,["Now there is a joke about the new rich","people, in Russia especially."]],[1455,["Russians are not like that, normally."]],[1458,["They don’t accept something because it is","a fashion."]],[1463,["So, one fellow said that: “My God, you lost","your hand in that accident!”"]],[1473,["“Doesn’t matter, but I lost my very","expensive watch from Switzerland.”"]],[1480,["“Really? What?” “It was a Rolex.”"]],[1483,["Doesn’t matter if the hand is gone."]],[1486,["The Rolex is gone! Rolex is the fashion."]],[1490,["[Can you remove him down, this one,","because people can’t see you.]"]],[1495,["So these are new rich people who have","money."]],[1499,["(Dog is on the stage: It’s alright now,","he’ll be able. Come along, come along. Ah."]],[1506,["Sit down, sit down. Now go down)"]],[1517,["They (the dogs) don’t follow any fashions,"]],[1519,["I have not seen dogs taking to any","fashions."]],[1523,["Monkeys is taking - I mean, supposing, you","see the Italian designers"]],[1529,["make something special for them, they","won’t think much of it."]],[1533,["Maybe their masters might buy it, but not","these animals."]],[1541,["Now, we don’t have to become animals","of course,"]],[1543,["but we don’t also have to become","slaves of fashions."]],[1548,["So there are some shops which are very","expensive."]],[1551,["Why? Because they are designers."]],[1554,["So you move about telling everybody, “See,","I am wearing this thing"]],[1558,["from a designer shop, this is from designer","shop.”"]],[1562,["That means, what about you?"]],[1565,["You have no sense of designs, you have","no sense of understanding"]],[1571,["what you need and what you don’t need."]],[1574,["And nowadays most of them are in jail also,","sorry to say,"]],[1578,["but they have money and they have made","money by befooling you."]],[1584,["Specially in America I was surprised that","they were selling most of the things"]],[1590,["which were coming from Italy designs,","Italian designs,"]],[1594,["written down Italian design, so they were","buying it, Italian design."]],[1600,["I was surprised that such artistic things","they create"]],[1607,["that are available everywhere, such","beautiful things."]],[1613,["But what they believe in, is some sort","of a group madness."]],[1620,["Everybody wearing the same kind of design","is from this or that."]],[1626,["This is not Sahaj Dharma. We are not","slaves of anything."]],[1630,["We are free people. We have not to accept","any design or anything."]],[1634,["Ah, it is there, is there! Let the stupid","follow that."]],[1639,["We are Sahaja Yogis."]],[1642,["Now, this also prevails among people who","are supposed to be sadhus,"]],[1646,["they all dress up the same way."]],[1650,["How can you make out who is who?"]],[1653,["In Sahaja Yoga, we don’t want you to dress","up the same way,"]],[1657,["look the same way, cut your hair the same","way. No."]],[1661,["You have to be individuals, because you","are free,"]],[1665,["but that doesn’t mean - freedom is always","supported by wisdom -"]],[1670,["that doesn’t mean that you do what you","like."]],[1675,["All kinds of funny things happen when","a person doesn’t know"]],[1680,["what is the light of the Spirit.","In the light of the Spirit,"]],[1686,["you don’t get involved into this kind","of collective madness that is going on."]],[1693,["We are so collective in mad things."]],[1696,["I wish they could be collective more","in wise things."]],[1701,["Wisdom is very important and a joy-giving","quality of Radhaji,"]],[1708,["Ahlada Dayini Shakti, has to come within","us."]],[1712,["Means, when we meet another person","in the collectivity,"]],[1717,["another person should feel happy meeting","you."]],[1722,["So He taught the Dharma of love."]],[1727,["Love is not there if you discard because","he is black or because he is brown,"]],[1733,["because he is white. It’s very","superficial -"]],[1740,["what is black, white and yellow? I don’t","understand."]],[1745,["Here they go to the sea shores to make","themselves black"]],[1750,["and there they say, “We don’t want to have","any blacks,” specially for Americans."]],[1758,["I think this kind of separation I found","there,"]],[1765,["among the blacks and the whites, I really","wept."]],[1770,["I went to Harlem. Sahaja yogis said,","“Mother, will you go to Harlem?”"]],[1774,["I said, “Why not, I’m black. If you call","me black, I’m black."]],[1778,["If you call me white, I’m white. If you","call me yellow, I’m yellow."]],[1782,["So, I’m going.” And there I had a lecture,","you know,"]],[1786,["so many people were there, really I cannot","forget."]],[1788,["It is one of the most famous place that","there is built in that hall"]],[1796,["and the same hall is built in Australia","where I had addressed many people."]],[1805,["I thought, “Just look at this!” They said,","“Mother, the Australians copied from us.”"]],[1811,["Now, these people, so sweet, so beautiful,","I tell you."]],[1815,["I could see their heart, I could feel it","and the fellow was trying to compere."]],[1821,["After my lecture he just came, he hugged","me, kissed me."]],[1824,["I mean, he would have even minced me,","a little boy"]],[1828,["about twenty-two years of age; such love","he felt."]],[1833,["And he said, “Mother, next time You come,","You are going to come to Harlem.”"]],[1836,["But I am told that hall is closed."]],[1839,["So the Americans system somehow or another","goes against democracy,"]],[1848,["not only against democracy but against","what Abraham Lincoln wanted."]],[1856,["They had such a great man there"]],[1861,["and there is a little street I saw in his","name."]],[1865,["Of course in Washington they say they have","some nice, beautiful statues."]],[1874,["But otherwise his principles are finished,"]],[1878,["his ideals are finished because somehow","or other,"]],[1886,["some people came and wrote against -"]],[1889,["from England especially - against the black","people."]],[1897,["What business they have to write against","something that is created by God?"]],[1902,["If there are the same colours everywhere,"]],[1905,["they all will look like military people."]],[1908,["They have to have different colors,"]],[1911,["they have to have different hues."]],[1914,["See, look at the trees, look at","the flowers."]],[1917,["And look at the different hues the sky has,"]],[1922,["just to make us happy – Alladha."]],[1926,["What gives you happiness is variety.","Variety is a sign of beauty."]],[1933,["If there is no variety, it’s so boring","I tell you, so very boring."]],[1938,["But they are very proud of it and they","think no end of themselves."]],[1943,["They think they are very great people, they","have a sense of superiority,"]],[1948,["because they have a certain type of nose"]],[1952,["or maybe certain type of lips or maybe","certain types of hair."]],[1957,["Such stupid things they are and you join","hands with them."]],[1961,["How can you join hands with them?"]],[1963,["You want your freedom? Then be a free","person."]],[1967,["In the freedom you have to have variety,","very important."]],[1973,["I would say that, now, the Sahaja Yogis who","are going back to America"]],[1978,["should have a new style of drive: go","to the black people."]],[1984,["I was very happy to see the South American","seminar,"]],[1989,["that they had taken specially to aboriginal","people."]],[1995,["They went and met them. I have met them","also"]],[1998,["and I was so surprised"]],[2001,["that they immediately said, “Mother,","You are spiritual, we know,"]],[2005,["but can You solve our problem?” I said,","“What’s your problem?”"]],[2009,["“Very simple, we have a land.”","“It’s alright, then?”"]],[2013,["“Very little land, five, six acres of land"]],[2016,["that belongs to us where the sage grows.”"]],[2019,["Sage is a kind of a, according to them,","is a holy plant. All right."]],[2026,["“Now, we always meet, all of us, there","for different festivals"]],[2032,["because we regard that land as a holy","land.”"]],[2035,["They know so many things, you know."]],[2038,["This is a holy land - there were vibrations","for that."]],[2042,["So they always used to meet. So natural!"]],[2046,["“So, what has happened now, what is your","problem?”"]],[2049,["“The government has sold this land, this","American government, to an Indian.”"]],[2054,["I said, “To an Indian?” “Yes, so can you","request this Indian"]],[2058,["to return it to us? We’ll pay him the","money.”"]],[2061,["I said, “What’s the name of the Indian?”"]],[2063,["They told me the name, I said, “My God!"]],[2066,["He is a Sindhi, Sindhi!"]],[2069,["He won’t leave you even one single pai,","is he going to give you this?"]],[2073,["I’m sorry, I may be Divine or I may be","anything, I can’t help you.”"]],[2080,["But I was surprised nobody raised a voice","against it."]],[2084,["They should have raised voice. They should","have told the government,"]],[2087,["“Please return their land. Why do you want","to have it?"]],[2091,["Why want to grab it?” As it is all","the Americans are immigrants."]],[2096,["They don’t belong to that place, that they","were not owners of that place,"]],[2103,["they’d gone – they are immigrants."]],[2106,["So they have no right to keep somebody’s","land like that"]],[2110,["and then to think they are superior.","It’s very nice,"]],[2112,["somebody enters your house and thinks he is","very superior"]],[2115,["and drives out all the people","of the family."]],[2119,["That is what has happened in America and","just opposite is Sahaj Dharma."]],[2124,["With Sahaj Dharma, you take people into","your heart, you love them."]],[2133,["Your love flows all the time, your","compassion flows all the time."]],[2139,["To me it’s a problem, this body is more","compassionate than myself."]],[2143,["I don’t even think of compassion and this","body just grasps everything."]],[2147,["It wants to solve the problem of others"]],[2151,["but I don’t think you can have that kind","of a body, you shouldn’t have."]],[2156,["But, at least you should have a heart","which is open."]],[2160,["You see on the street somebody who is","a dark fellow."]],[2163,["I like about the black Americans, that","once I got down in one airport,"]],[2173,["so one gentleman, black gentleman said,","“Hello darling, how are You?"]],[2179,["How are You here? Very happy to see You!”"]],[2182,["“I’m happy to see you. How are you?”"]],[2186,["Then once I was traveling in... what was","the airport? Ursula was with me."]],[2196,["So he looked at me, one fellow, very tall,","hefty, fat, you know."]],[2203,["He said, “Ah! Are You back again?” “Ah”."]],[2207,["I said, “I’m back. You know me?”","“Of course, of course, I know You.”"]],[2211,["He had never met me, I had never known him."]],[2216,["But I felt happy, I felt very happy."]],[2221,["That’s the best way to meet people."]],[2224,["Supposing you are walking on the street,","you see some black gentleman going."]],[2229,["It’s a terrible life there, I tell you,","it’s a terrible life for them."]],[2234,["I’ve known, I’ve read books on them, I’ve","cried and wept and I felt very sorry."]],[2239,["So, as a Sahaja yogi, you should just jump","at them"]],[2243,["and you should say, “Hello, how are you?”","Shake hands with them."]],[2247,["They won’t cut your throat, I can tell you","this."]],[2252,["In criminality, I don’t know who is more","criminal in America,"]],[2256,["whether they are the blacks or","the whites, competing."]],[2260,["But, if you are kind and if you are loving,"]],[2264,["you can remove that part of criminality","which is within them"]],[2267,["because hatred can be only washed away","by pure love."]],[2273,["But people think they are very cunning,","very superior in cunningness, of course."]],[2279,["Otherwise, what is their superiority?"]],[2283,["Only this complexion, this white complexion","is the worst of all."]],[2289,["I was very fair, very fair, till I got","married, or for some time,"]],[2294,["and then I started becoming darker and","darker."]],[2298,["Because white complexion gets all kinds","of, see..."]],[2301,["the light you put on me, I absorb, I get","a black spot."]],[2305,["So it’s not a very great thing to be white,","I don’t think so."]],[2309,["It looks very funny and pale and joyless."]],[2314,["But no use going to the sea, making your","body, I think brown,"]],[2319,["brown, not so black, brown and then","suffering from cancer of the skin."]],[2328,["This kind of stupidity is also very much","fashionable."]],[2333,["Now, in collectivity, how much do we get","impressed"]],[2338,["by this, we should be on the watch."]],[2342,["I saw my granddaughter was wearing","a sleeveless dress."]],[2347,["I told her, “Better you shouldn’t wear","a sleeveless dress.”"]],[2349,["She says, “It’s very hot, I feel very hot.”","She’s young."]],[2353,["I said, “But see, these are two very","important chakras."]],[2356,["If you expose them, then you’ll have","a problem.”"]],[2361,["She doesn’t like to wear dresses which are","above the knee,"]],[2367,["but she says, “People wear even above","the knee.”"]],[2369,["I said, “Knees, they are very important","chakras, we should keep them closed,"]],[2376,["otherwise if they are affected, we’ll have","knee trouble.”"]],[2380,["Immediately she changed – immediately."]],[2383,["“Mother, I’ll wear blouse from inside and","something from outside.”"]],[2388,["Immediately. Because she knew this is","a natural primordial taboo"]],[2394,["that we should not expose our these two","chakras and these chakras."]],[2402,["But, nowadays, the more you have long","legs, I don’t know,"]],[2411,["they have shorter clothes."]],[2414,["And I don’t understand what is in the legs,"]],[2417,["the whole beauty is in the legs or what?"]],[2421,["So, I’ve met one lady who traveled with me."]],[2426,["She was wearing a burkha because she was","a Moslem"]],[2430,["and by the time we landed in London, she","took out the burkha"]],[2434,["and the dress was much above the knees."]],[2439,["I said, “What kind of Muslim woman is she?"]],[2443,["She’s worse than even Christians because","they wouldn’t wear such a thing."]],[2449,["You know, to come out of the aeroplane,"]],[2453,["you have to come down on the staircase.”"]],[2455,["No “Lajja”, no shame, nothing,","shamelessness!"]],[2461,["So, Sahaj Dharma is that you have shame,","you have sense of shame."]],[2469,["What you talk to others, what you say","to others,"]],[2472,["how you behave towards them, in the Sahaj","Dharma is Alladha dayini."]],[2480,["If something is not Alladha dayini, keep","quiet. Don’t say."]],[2484,["What is the need? What is there to be","sarcastic?"]],[2489,["Showing off your brains in your sarcasm."]],[2496,["It’s not a sign of good breeding"]],[2500,["that you talk sarcastically to others","in a sharp way."]],[2505,["But if you talk sweetly, what’s the harm?"]],[2509,["This sweetness comes from Radhaji."]],[2515,["Now, of course they have misused Her"]],[2518,["and made it into a sort of a Romeo and","Juliet business. It was not that way."]],[2523,["She was a very pure woman and She","was Mahalakshmi."]],[2529,["So, to be a Mahalaksmi, after coming","to Sahaja Yoga, you should know"]],[2536,["that you should dress up in a way that’s","perfectly alright."]],[2543,["Once I remember, I was in a big party","and one gentleman came"]],[2552,["and he sat down, “Aaaaaah!” I said,","“What happened?”"]],[2557,["“What a relief, Mother, Mrs. Shrivastava,","to see You."]],[2562,["See these women, I’m fed up. But You","came, I felt such a relief.”"]],[2569,["I said, “What is so relieving?” “You are","so serene.”"]],[2574,["So, women are serene in Sahaj Dharma."]],[2580,["They are not stupid, frivolous, laughing","at anything."]],[2586,["That’s not the way for a woman. Anything","happens, they must laugh."]],[2591,["I mean, there is something laughable,","alright,"]],[2595,["but some things are not even laughable,","they laugh."]],[2598,["That’s not the way. That can be ridiculous","also, can ridicule others."]],[2603,["But, laugh of appreciation, laugh","of enjoyment,"]],[2610,["is so pure and creates such a beautiful","atmosphere."]],[2616,["I think the whole ecological problem is in","our brains and your upbringing."]],[2623,["It is not outside."]],[2627,["It is inside us, which is reflected","outside."]],[2633,["In Ganesha Puja I’m going to tell you how","we are so closely related to Mother Earth"]],[2638,["and how the Mother Earth and the atmosphere","reacts"]],[2642,["to our behavior, to how we live."]],[2647,["In the Sahaj Dharma, you give up lust and","greed very easily, that I know."]],[2653,["I mean, if they can’t even give up that,"]],[2656,["then they should not call themselves Sahaja","Yogis."]],[2659,["The first thing you give up is lust and","greed."]],[2663,["I find it among young people now,"]],[2666,["that those who come to Sahaja Yoga","become really very free people."]],[2674,["They don’t run after women."]],[2678,["Women don’t run after men."]],[2681,["They are together, they sit together, talk","together, laugh together,"]],[2685,["but it is purity that is there."]],[2689,["In the Koran it is described that when","Kyama will come,"]],[2695,["beautiful women and beautiful men will","be there,"]],[2700,["but they’ll have no lust and greed, they’ll","be pure."]],[2703,["It is today, you can see – that lust and","greed is finished"]],[2710,["in most of you – most of you. Automatically","it is finished"]],[2715,["and now you can see for yourself that","you’re free of this bondage."]],[2722,["Then our marriages are coming tomorrow."]],[2736,["In the Sahaj Dharma, first thing is very","important is forgiveness."]],[2745,["If somebody cannot forgive, then he cannot","be a Sahaja Yogi -"]],[2751,["forgiveness. How this forgiveness comes in"]],[2756,["is by forgetting the past. Otherwise you’ll","go on saying,"]],[2761,["“This person tortured me, that person","tortured me,"]],[2765,["he was very mean to me, he was that to me,","he did this to me.”"]],[2770,["Shows that you are not of that calibre","to understand Sahaja Yoga -"]],[2775,["because you cannot forgive."]],[2779,["What is there to remember? The present is","the best."]],[2783,["Now if you are sitting here with me,","enjoying the Alladha dayini Shakti,"]],[2788,["that time if you are thinking about","the past, shows what?"]],[2791,["That you are not of the calibre."]],[2795,["To be the calibre of Sahaja Yoga, you","should be free of your past."]],[2800,["Finished. There's no need to confess."]],[2804,["I know after Sahaja Yoga many people wrote","letters to me of confessions"]],[2809,["and I just said, “Baba, just burn these","letters."]],[2813,["I don’t remember. I don’t want to read","anything about anyone.”"]],[2818,["So, there should be forgiveness."]],[2821,["If there is forgiveness, you’ll be","surprised,"]],[2823,["you’ll feel very relieved and your married","life will be very happy."]],[2828,["But if you try to remember something...","Alright,"]],[2832,["some marriages are really, really very","difficult, alright, so you get out."]],[2837,["In Sahaja Yoga we have allowed complete","divorce,"]],[2841,["but must be with some reason,"]],[2843,["not because you think something is","superior."]],[2847,["Now we have banned many countries"]],[2851,["from where we don’t want to have girls"]],[2853,["or from where we don’t want to have boys."]],[2855,["What is the reason? With experience we","have learned,"]],[2858,["they are not marriage substance."]],[2864,["Now, then better not marry."]],[2868,["And if you marry then live like an ideal","Sahaja Yogi."]],[2875,["Also, if you are a Sahaja Yogini,"]],[2878,["then you can carry on very much better","by forgiving all the time."]],[2885,["Every time, when people tell me,","“Mother,"]],[2888,["You see, You must help me.” “Why?”"]],[2890,["“Because, You know, my husband doesn’t","give me any money.”"]],[2894,["I said, “Give him up. I don’t mind."]],[2898,["He must give you money. Why doesn’t he","give you money?”"]],[2901,["If you talk to the husband, he’ll say,","“Mother, she’s very extravagant.”"]],[2904,["I said, “You better give up Sahaja Yoga","both of you and do what you like.”"]],[2911,["In Sahaj Dharma, the husband-wife’s","relation should be really romantic,"]],[2917,["should be really beautiful."]],[2919,["It is not, you know, we talk of love and","all that here,"]],[2923,["very rarely people fall in love and carry","on with it."]],[2927,["It’s a blessing if you really get that kind","of a feeling."]],[2932,["But mostly it is a curse."]],[2937,["So to fall in love is very good"]],[2941,["but that doesn’t mean you forget that you","are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2945,["In that, Sahaja Yoga helps a lot, I think,","in your married life."]],[2951,["Same, dharma is for your children, that you","bring up your children -"]],[2957,["not troubling them too much, but into","a free life."]],[2962,["Let them use their wisdom."]],[2964,["Sometimes I know children go astray and","try to follow wrong things."]],[2969,["Then you must correct them, you must tell","them, it is your duty."]],[2973,["They were not born out of the trees"]],[2975,["but they were born here, from the parents."]],[2979,["So it is the duty of the parents to tell","them that this is wrong"]],[2983,["and this should not be done."]],[2985,["It’s a very wrong thing, you should correct","that"]],[2988,["and that correction should be in a Sahaj","way."]],[2994,["I’ll tell you an example."]],[2999,["I had a problem once, with somebody","coming to me and saying,"]],[3008,["“Mother, I can’t do without smoking, I","have to smoke.”"]],[3013,["I said, “Better smoke then, but you can’t","be a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3018,["because a smoking Sahaja Yogi is a funny","caricature, you know,"]],[3021,["I can’t think of a Sahaja Yogi smoking."]],[3025,["How will I look if I start smoking like","that?” “Ah, horrible!”"]],[3030,["I said, “Then if you are my son, you cannot","smoke, it looks bad.”"]],[3035,["He gave up smoking, can you imagine?"]],[3039,["So, dealing with children, always make","yourself an example,"]],[3044,["yourself part and parcel of that event."]],[3047,["So the children don’t feel, you know."]],[3050,["This is something that I have talked","many-a-times."]],[3060,["Children is one thing I tell you,"]],[3063,["they can give up everything but not your","love."]],[3067,["If they know you love them, they will not","accept anything"]],[3074,["that will make you not love - not love","them."]],[3081,["This is for definite, because children are","the best people who know about love."]],[3088,["Of course, I don’t know, I feel that","in English language,"]],[3092,["I didn’t see many books about children","written beautiful, beautiful things."]],[3099,["There was one book that was published","when I was in London:"]],[3102,["“The children talking about","the politicians”,"]],[3105,["and they published I think, 5000 books and","that very same day it was finished."]],[3111,["So, talk to children, talk to them. You’ll","be amazed, they are full of honey."]],[3118,["They have such nice, nice things with them"]],[3121,["and when they talk like that, then you","are amazed"]],[3125,["how they say things, how they talk","of Sahaj,"]],[3129,["how they are expressing their spiritual","strength."]],[3138,["Now, we have many very good children and","also they are absolutely Sahaj."]],[3148,["One boy came and he just prostrated himself","before me."]],[3153,["So, I said, “Why you did it?”"]],[3155,["“I was getting cool vibrations, Mother,","from You, so I did it.”"]],[3163,["“Is it, you like it?”","“Of course!”"]],[3167,["“More than chocolate?”","“Of course!”"]],[3170,["I was surprised. “What... you eat them or","what?”"]],[3174,["“No, no need to eat, you know, you feel","so happy inside"]],[3179,["and I feel, Mother, You are putting Your","hand on my heart"]],[3184,["and trying to console me.”"]],[3187,["I was surprised. “And where is your heart?”"]],[3189,["He said, “It’s here, here is my heart,","I feel it here.”"]],[3193,["Just imagine, what love and what","understanding of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3199,["For these little children who are below","even five years."]],[3204,["Now, you are all grown up children of mine"]],[3207,["and I want you to know all the beauties","that are within you,"]],[3212,["that you have to enjoy. First of all, learn","to laugh at yourself."]],[3216,["That’s the best way to enjoy yourself,","you know."]],[3222,["And not to spend much time looking in","the mirror, that’s another way."]],[3229,["You spend too much at the mirror, then","there’s something wrong with you."]],[3233,["I think, personally, that it’s a kind of","a possession may be."]],[3238,["So, what you should see inside: “Are we","Sahaj Dharmies?”"]],[3244,["Mother has established Sahaj Dharma,"]],[3247,["much more than what Krishna wanted","to establish."]],[3250,["He wanted to establish the Dharma of love","which of course we have,"]],[3256,["but apart from that we have so many other","beautiful facets"]],[3261,["and such beautiful things within our","personality"]],[3265,["that we have forgotten to enjoy."]],[3271,["So, the attention should be on your own","qualities, on your own personalities"]],[3278,["and then you’ll be amazed how your","personality is giving you joy,"]],[3285,["giving you Alladha, giving you so much","of patience with others."]],[3294,["To Me the whole thing looks like sometimes","a joke"]],[3298,["because nothing so serious."]],[3303,["It’s not a Rama’s type that you have","to be serious."]],[3307,["I don’t have to kill anybody, I don’t use","any weapons in this lifetime."]],[3315,["Without weapons if things are solved, what","can you do?"]],[3319,["But you must try to see the beauty","as Sahaja Yogis."]],[3322,["You should be sensitive to see how you","have been helped,"]],[3327,["how you have been guided, how you have","been blessed."]],[3331,["This is sahaj dharma."]],[3334,["If you cannot know that, then you live","on a very low level."]],[3339,["I mean, it’s not fault of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3342,["but it’s your style, you are not sensitive."]],[3346,["Supposing somebody does not know that he","is burning his hand."]],[3354,["So what will you do?"]],[3357,["He has no sense, he has no sensitivity,","he cannot feel."]],[3361,["He can drink, he can smoke, he can do","everything"]],[3365,["and still he Is existing, alright."]],[3369,["Must be a rakshasa, I think or I don’t know","what to say."]],[3374,["So, we have to take example from other good","Sahaja Yogis"]],[3379,["and not from the bad ones and how do we","proceed in enjoyment -"]],[3387,["which is a ocean, just an ocean."]],[3390,["For example, now, I came, everybody was","trying to fan."]],[3396,["But also in the West another problem is"]],[3398,["they like to live in hermetically sealed","rooms, hermetically sealed cars,"]],[3403,["they are very afraid of draught, I don’t","know, as if they’ll be thrown away"]],[3407,["or what will happen to them. They don’t","want draught."]],[3410,["I mean draught is not coming from some","iceberg."]],[3415,["So, they don’t believe in the fresh air","at all"]],[3419,["and that’s one other reason that people are","very suffocating sometimes, you know,"]],[3426,["they just suffocate. They are used","to a suffocating life."]],[3430,["Once I was in India, I was very hot, so","somebody was driving me,"]],[3436,["but the person who was there was from","a Western country."]],[3441,["He said, “Don’t open - don’t open","the window.”"]],[3444,["I said, “Why?” “There’s a draught.”","I said, “In this country, in India"]],[3448,["people live in the open. What is a draught?"]],[3452,["What draught you are talking about?”"]],[3454,["You can’t open the door, you can’t open","the window,"]],[3457,["you can’t open anything, if you open","anything,"]],[3460,["they’ll be all dead, you see as if.","So open yourself!"]],[3467,["As it is about the nature, also it is","in their private lives."]],[3472,["They don’t want to open."]],[3478,["If somebody comes to their house,","“Oh, my God,"]],[3480,["now we’ll have to share the wines,"]],[3484,["we’ll have to share the foods.” They cannot","share."]],[3490,["They cannot share. That is most","uncollective."]],[3499,["But in India, I must say, people have","a good sharing capacity"]],[3504,["because they are still primitive, they are","still primordial,"]],[3510,["yet not gone out of the way to satisfy","their own ego."]],[3519,["But I think somehow or other in India,","people like to share."]],[3533,["If you want to please any Indian, you tell","them,"]],[3536,["“tomorrow I’ll come and have food with","you.” His wife will jump."]],[3540,["She’ll say, “Now what do you like, tell me,","what food do you like?”"]],[3544,["She will jump. But otherwise, what happens,"]],[3550,["as soon as you say he Is coming for food,","the wife will say,"]],[3553,["“No, no, I am going to my mother.”"]],[3560,["Immediately she’ll have a programme."]],[3566,["I just don’t understand. They’ll have","beautiful houses,"]],[3570,["very clean, very beautiful everything,"]],[3573,["but if somebody comes to their house, they","get a shock"]],[3577,["as if electricity has entered. So, for whom","is all this?"]],[3585,["To show off, they will borrow money from","the banks."]],[3590,["Even Indians in America they do."]],[3592,["They want to have three Mercedes, four","houses, for what?"]],[3600,["Borrowing money, with borrowing money","they’ll do it."]],[3603,["Sahaja Yogis have not to borrow any money."]],[3609,["There is no need, you can do away with","things."]],[3613,["Why to have so many cars?"]],[3616,["Nowadays, people don’t even walk at all."]],[3620,["We used to go to our school, my father had","a car in India - nothing doing."]],[3626,["We had to walk. We used to climb one","mountain."]],[3629,["It was about five miles the school – every","morning."]],[3634,["Then in the night, in the evening, the car","used to come, you see."]],[3639,["And I would walk with my bare feet,"]],[3642,["because so much vibrations were there,","and the chappals,"]],[3646,["I thought were cutting my vibrations,"]],[3649,["so I used to have chappals in my hand and","walk."]],[3653,["One day, we had a new driver, my father","sent him."]],[3657,["He said, “How will I know who is","your daughter?”"]],[3660,["He said, “Any girl with the chappals in her","hand is the one whom you have to bring.”"]],[3667,["So, it is to enjoy your nobility, to enjoy","your generosity."]],[3675,["It’s very important. And not to side","with anyone."]],[3680,["You are not identified with anyone."]],[3684,["It’s much better now, I think, because","since you have taken to Sahaj Dharma,"]],[3689,["I’ve seen - English will tell you what’s","wrong with English,"]],[3693,["Swiss will tell you what’s wrong with","Swiss,"]],[3696,["Indians will tell you what’s wrong with","Indians. Actually, I learnt from them."]],[3700,["I don’t know these things are there."]],[3702,["Russians will tell you what’s wrong with","Russians."]],[3705,["They immediately start seeing, “What’s","wrong with us?"]],[3710,["Where do we lack in this?”"]],[3713,["Because the collectivity of being in one","country, say as an Indian,"]],[3721,["we see now, what’s happening in India,","all corrupt, horrible, this, that."]],[3729,["So, I said, “Alright, if you don’t like","India, why don’t you go somewhere else?”"]],[3731,["“No, no, no, no, that - we will stay here,"]],[3734,["but this is a very corrupt government, they","are very bad, this, that.”"]],[3741,["Anywhere you go, you will find immediately","they see -"]],[3746,["because you don’t know they are now chosen","to change their country."]],[3755,["I have taken up many questions now,","of India"]],[3759,["and I’m going to start working on that","level now."]],[3764,["We have already started, in a way, for","the destitute women,"]],[3769,["then for other type of poverty and all","that."]],[3772,["Just by saying, remove poverty, poverty","cannot be lost."]],[3776,["You have to have feeling for the poor,","then only."]],[3781,["But you get with more that feeling because","you are an Indian."]],[3787,["You are an Indian, so what? Your own","brothers, sisters starving."]],[3792,["You get that very deep feeling within you","if you are a Sahaj Dharmi."]],[3797,["So, this is the new Dharma we have","established now in this world."]],[3801,["A new race, with a new Dharma, which is","much above"]],[3806,["even Shri Krishna’s vision is coming","through."]],[3811,["He describes in the beginning. I think,","He was not a good salesman,"]],[3816,["because He describes the best first;"]],[3819,["you see, the salesman first will start from","two rupees,"]],[3823,["then go onward to two thousand rupies.","But He first told us"]],[3828,["that you have to become Sthita Pragnya,","means Sahaja Yogi -"]],[3832,["and then Shri Krishna was asked a question","by Arjuna,"]],[3837,["“What is a Sthita Pragya?” Then He","describes a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3841,["that He describes before, first chapter,","second chapter is that."]],[3845,["Now, then the questions start. You know,","Arjuna was a great questioner, I think."]],[3852,["So, he starts asking questions, “Then what","about this"]],[3855,["and what about that and what about that?”"]],[3858,["So He goes on explaining to him that,"]],[3862,["“You see, this is all just a Maya, this is","all an illusion you have."]],[3868,["Get out of this illusion."]],[3871,["If once you get out of this illusion,”","because Arjuna said,"]],[3875,["“They are my relations, they are my","teachers. How can I kill them?”"]],[3880,["So, Krishna says, “Nobody is killed.”"]],[3883,["He said, “Nobody is killed, but they are","being killed"]],[3886,["because they are not following the Satya","Dharma, so it’s alright.”"]],[3891,["What is your brother, what is your sister?"]],[3893,["They are not following the Satya Dharma,"]],[3896,["so you have nothing to do with them."]],[3898,["If you can correct them and help them,","it’s alright, otherwise forget them."]],[3902,["First, deal with people who are straight."]],[3907,["Like we should say that we must deal with","people who are simple, innocent"]],[3912,["and then you can take to difficult people","when you are that good."]],[3918,["Otherwise you will come here saying,","“Mother,"]],[3920,["I have caught this, I have caught that.”"]],[3922,["So, in Sahaj Dharma, you being the Spirit,"]],[3925,["you also know about others, very well","and you can make it out,"]],[3932,["who is who, what chakras they are catching."]],[3935,["But the trouble in America, I found that","Sahaja Yogis used to,"]],[3942,["just could go and tell somebody, “You are","catching on this chakra.”"]],[3947,["Now, he has come for the first time and you","tell him,"]],[3949,["“You, you are very egoistical.” He says,","“How do you know?”"]],[3953,["“Your Agnya is catching.” Maybe, his own","Agnya might be catching."]],[3957,["Is this the way to receive a new person?"]],[3960,["Is this the way to talk to a new person?"]],[3964,["See, on the contrary, you should say,","“Come, sit down,"]],[3967,["very nice, you are very great, see?”"]],[3970,["Because they are still ignorant, so they","like some sort of"]],[3975,["buttering, as you call it, you see, we call","it chaplusi. Then, gradually,"]],[3981,["because you are doing this just to make","him a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3986,["because you love him. Basically that is","the reason."]],[3989,["But as soon as somebody comes in,","if you tell him,"]],[3991,["“This is wrong with you, that’s wrong","with you.”"]],[3995,["This is not a Pope’s business,"]],[4000,["where you go on telling people what’s","wrong with them,"]],[4002,["go and confess. To whom?"]],[4005,["To all these silly people. It’s not that."]],[4008,["What we have to show; that you have fallen","in love with that person,"]],[4013,["you are nice to that person because you","like that person."]],[4017,["Then gradually you pull him up."]],[4019,["But as soon as he comes you give him one","shot, so finished."]],[4023,["How can you have good relations?"]],[4027,["Americans have to learn this."]],[4028,["I don’t know why Americans think they are","very superior people."]],[4032,["I tell you for wisdom I would not say they","are so much."]],[4037,["It’s completely lacking – wisdom in them."]],[4040,["And they misunderstand people very fast,"]],[4045,["start judging others, is not the way you","can have Sahaj Dharma."]],[4049,["Sahaj Dharma is – you are your own. You","are in your own,"]],[4054,["you are in your own realm and in your","happiness and joy."]],[4057,["Where is the time to criticise others?"]],[4062,["So the best thing is to show your maximum","love to everyone."]],[4068,["In that love, you should not show your pity"]],[4071,["but love which is again: Alladha dayini."]],[4075,["This is the message of Shri Krishna but","I don’t know how many understood it."]],[4080,["Now, what you find those who are following","Shri Krishna, like Hare Rama people,"]],[4086,["they are really beggars on the street."]],[4090,["He is Kubera, and his disciples are all","beggars, can you imagine."]],[4094,["Does it add to His glory as Kubera?"]],[4098,["So, Sahaja Yogis are not like that."]],[4102,["Should be generous, should not bother too","much about yourself."]],[4110,["Should not all the time think about","yourself,"]],[4113,["but think of the collectivity, how you","behave."]],[4121,["Collectivity is not to bring – force people","to come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4126,["Once they come to Sahaja Yoga they will","know the joy of life"]],[4130,["and you don’t have to tell them anything.","Nothing has to be told,"]],[4134,["just silently it will work and they will","feel your love."]],[4140,["You see, love is something so great."]],[4143,["It not only helps others but it also","helps you."]],[4149,["It’s so joyous to give realisation to","others."]],[4153,["But if you start telling, “Your this chakra","is catching”,"]],[4156,["why are you giving realisation?"]],[4157,["If you don’t know how to give realisation,","better not do it."]],[4162,["So, to criticise is not the way we can","enjoy love."]],[4168,["Ah, of course you can pull the legs of each","other sometimes,"]],[4172,["just for fun’s sake, but not to harm,"]],[4176,["not to torture, not to make that person","fall."]],[4184,["You are all Sahaj Dharmies, you have","accepted Sahaj Dharma"]],[4189,["and in Sahaj Dharma we have to have","pure love of the heart,"]],[4196,["not hypocrisy, and a sensible life."]],[4203,["Now, this Pope is against abortion.","I’m not."]],[4209,["If a woman is suffering, let her have","abortion."]],[4212,["The one who is living is more important","than the ones who are not living."]],[4217,["If somebody wants to have abortion, that","child can be born again."]],[4223,["According to us, nobody dies permanently,"]],[4229,["whatever it may be."]],[4231,["So, this is one way they use it for","propagation of human beings."]],[4241,["Like they say the Moslem women are","a like a factory."]],[4244,["They go on producing more children, more","children, more children."]],[4247,["So there are more voters."]],[4251,["So the Pope knows that. That’s why he","says, “Abortion, No.”"]],[4255,["Christians should not abort, because","then there will be"]],[4258,["less Christians to compete with","the Moslems."]],[4266,["But in Sahaja Yoga, we don’t have such","funny, radical, nonsensical things."]],[4272,["We have divorce, and we have also abortion,"]],[4277,["which is important to understand that these","are all taboos which are there."]],[4286,["But not for people who have to get out","of the troubles –"]],[4293,["you have to help them. Then that’s how","it works."]],[4298,["But to be very frank, we don’t have to do","abortions,"]],[4301,["it is achieved by Paramchaitanya."]],[4306,["Paramchaitanya does for me. I don’t have","to."]],[4310,["I don’t have to do anything. It’s","Paramchaitanya."]],[4314,["It’s nice because it knows what is to be","done, how to achieve it."]],[4320,["And sometimes you are in trouble, then know"]],[4323,["that you are not leaving things into the","hands of the Paramchaitanya."]],[4327,["If you leave it into the hands","of Paramchaitanya"]],[4329,["things will work out very well."]],[4334,["So, to understand Sahaja Yoga, first and","foremost thing is,"]],[4337,["how much you are enjoying yourself?"]],[4341,["How much enjoyment are you giving","to others?"]],[4346,["For that you have music, you have this,","that."]],[4350,["I was saying that today I won’t speak much,"]],[4352,["but, somehow, with Shri Krishna you can’t","keep quiet."]],[4359,["He played Murli, Bansuri, flute. Look","at Him."]],[4369,["I talked to you, but He just played Murli."]],[4375,["He didn’t talk so much, except for","the Gita, you won’t find Him talking."]],[4380,["And those who read also Gita are horrible","people, I tell you, I have met,"]],[4385,["those who read Gita. They don’t understand","what Shri Krishna’s Dharma is."]],[4390,["If they don’t understand Shri Krishna, how","will they understand Sahaja Yoga?"]],[4394,["So, for all of you is to practice on love,"]],[4404,["on forgiveness, on appreciating others,","on giving joy to others."]],[4413,["Some of the Sahaja Yogis have been very","kind to me also."]],[4417,["Once I went to the shop to buy a sari,","for myself"]],[4421,["and the sari was very expensive for my","purpose. So, I didn’t buy."]],[4428,["Said, “Let it be. This colour suits me,","alright, but it doesn’t matter.”"]],[4435,["I didn’t have so much money to buy that."]],[4438,["So, that Sahaja Yogi bought that sari"]],[4441,["and on my birthday gave me – and really,","I could not see"]],[4445,["because my eyes were filled with tears.","Just a small thing like that."]],[4452,["Normally I don’t expect you to do","anything for me, no."]],[4456,["But small, small things make you so happy."]],[4460,["But even if you do this to somebody, may","not understand,"]],[4463,["may not realize, may not feel it."]],[4465,["But if you are a Sahaja Yogi, you will."]],[4470,["So thank you very much; for all this that","I have said to you,"]],[4476,["try to enjoy yourself and make others","enjoy you."]],[4481,["May God bless you."]]]);
